# Ask mode responses

When the user is in **Ask mode** (read-only Q&A):

- Do **not** include code blocks, code citations, or file snippets unless they explicitly ask to see code.
- Keep answers **brief and scannable**; add detail only when the question genuinely needs it.
- Explain in **plain language** — the user wants to read explanations, not source code.
